     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">Even with just one presetting and measuring machine, you’ll save time and money with every tool change. Combined with TMS Tool Management Solutions, you’ll unlock additional options for reducing costs. </p> <p class=\"extra-large-text\">Measured and set tools reduce machine downtime by at least 15%. You’ll save at least 15,000 euros per CNC machine, per year, and per shift. That’s why ZOLLER’s presetting and measuring machines pay for themselves in a short period of time. </p> <p class=\"extra-large-text\">Use the ZOLLER profitability calculator now to calculate the potential savings for your production.</p>",
