   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The Simple Way to More Profit </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>The following parameters lie at the basis of the cost-effectiveness analysis:</strong></p><ul><li><p>ZOLLER guarantees savings of at least 15,000 euros per machine, per year, and per shift when preset tools are used</p></li><li><p>According to a study by RWTH Aachen (<strong>R</strong>heinisch-Westfälische <strong>T</strong>echnische<strong> H</strong>ochschule Aachen), annual tooling costs amount to 10% of the machine’s value</p></li><li><p>With ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions, you can increase your productivity by at least 5%</p></li></ul>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/7/csm_kosteneffizienz_einzel_b86afc398c.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1097,
